  {"i":5077,"t":["school"],"n":"Classroom phrase taught in the school unit; the 'while' meaning is too general to add time."},
  {"i":5082,"t":["food"],"s":{"1":["food","drink"]},"n":"Learners mainly meet it as soup/broth (味噌汁) or sauce, so food. Juice/sap (みかんの汁) is cooking-related, and drinkable juice is usually 果汁/ジュース, so drink only gets a sense entry."},
  {"i":5166,"t":["home"],"n":"A household or tool object; actions is too loose for a concrete noun."},
  {"i":5179,"t":["numbers"],"n":"General quantity word (多めに入れる, ご飯多めで) and not a unit, so measures is wrong. Food is just one context of use, not its theme."}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":5061,"keep":[2],"n":"Medical care (応急手当) is common at N3 and belongs in the health unit."},
  {"i":5062,"keep":[2,3],"n":"Black coffee is an everyday drink term. ブラック企業 (exploitative company) is a very common work term."},
  {"i":5082,"keep":[],"n":"汁 is mainly soup or broth, which 'food' covers. Juice as a drink is taught with ジュース, not 汁."},
  {"i":5092,"keep":[],"n":"Issuing passports, cards or receipts is general issuance, not something a teacher would teach in the money unit."},
  {"i":5103,"keep":[],"n":"A browser cookie is beyond a N5-N3 learner's needs; the course word is the biscuit."},
  {"i":5107,"keep":[2],"n":"'Formula' (数学の公式) is a common sense and is taught with maths and science."},
  {"i":5119,"keep":[],"n":"A turn in a game is usually 順番 or 番 at this level; ターン here is mainly physical turning."},
  {"i":5128,"keep":[3],"n":"A computer program is a very common sense and clearly belongs to technology."},
  {"i":5133,"keep":[2],"n":"Gas as a substance (排気ガス, gas vs. liquid) is common and fits science."},
  {"i":5137,"keep":[],"n":"折 read おり means 'occasion' here; folding is normally written 折り and is not taught with this headword."},
  {"i":5141,"keep":[2],"n":"〜おそれがある (risk, likelihood) is a core N3 pattern for possibility, so it belongs in thinking."},
  {"i":5164,"keep":[2],"n":"Conducting an orchestra is a common sense and is taught with music."},
  {"i":5167,"keep":[2],"n":"Withdrawing money (ATMでの引き出し) is common and belongs in the money unit."}
